1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,002
And here is the deeper trick of this unit: connectives with the same meaning need different grammar.

2
00:00:06,002 --> 00:00:12,968
Because takes a clause; because of takes a noun; therefore needs a full stop or a semicolon in front of it.

3
00:00:12,968 --> 00:00:14,726
Meaning is not enough.

4
00:00:14,726 --> 00:00:16,614
Always check what must follow.

